<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Polymer Group cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Polymer Group cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said it downgraded Polymer Group Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- said cut the 1997 earnings estimate to $0.82 a share from $0.90 a share and trimmed the 1998 estimate to $1.00 a share from $1.10 a share.</p>
<p>-- On Friday, Polymer posted second quarter operating earnings of $0.19 a share compared to $0.06 a share a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Polymer Group lost 7/8 to 14-3/4.</p>
</text>
